desc_content.doctest_block:
>>> new_conf = Conf(a=10, b="hi")  # an instance of our dataclass
>>> instantiate(new_conf)  # calls: `dict(a=10, b='hi')`
{'a': 10, 'b': 'hi'}

>>> Conf = builds(dict, a="${.s}", b="${.s}", zen_meta=dict(s=-10))
>>> instantiate(Conf)
{'a': -10, 'b': -10}
>>> instantiate(Conf, s=2)
{'a': 2, 'b': 2}
